note The handler, run once per frame after every view is built: takes the element tip the views attached this frame, reports which element the pointer rests on and whether the button is down (Action::Rest), then draws the code hover card if one is wanted and otherwise the element tip once its rest is due and the button is up. Whichever is drawn is reported as the shown tip (Action::TipShown), which dump prints.

